# Implementation Plan - LeadGrowth Enterprise CRM V3.2
## Call Duration Tracking, Productivity Analytics & Smart Auto Assignment Foundation

Upgrade LeadGrowth Enterprise CRM by implementing a production-ready, user-driven **Call Duration Tracking System** (Start Call / End Call workflow), live resumable timers, call history logs, multi-tier productivity analytics (User, Manager, Admin dashboards), report exports, WebSocket notifications, and the backend foundation for **Smart Lead Auto Assignment Engine** (Workload Score calculation).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Productivity Tracking Model**: This is a user-driven productivity tracking workflow using Start Call / End Call timestamps. No third-party telecom APIs (Twilio/Exotel) are required.
> - **Timer State Persistence**: If a user refreshes the browser or navigates between pages while a call is active, the frontend checks `/api/calls/active` on mount and seamlessly resumes the timer from `startTime` without resetting.
> - **Validation Rules**:
>   1. Only assigned users can start a call on a lead.
>   2. A user can have at most ONE active call session at a time across the entire workspace.
>   3. Completed call history is immutable and cannot be edited or deleted.

