## Proposed Changes

### Database Layer

#### [NEW] [CallHistory.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/entity/CallHistory.java)
Create `call_history` table entity mapping:
- `id` (Long, PK, Auto Increment)
- `lead` (ManyToOne -> Lead)
- `user` (ManyToOne -> User)
- `workspace` (ManyToOne -> Workspace)
- `startTime` (LocalDateTime, nullable = false)
- `endTime` (LocalDateTime, nullable = true)
- `durationSeconds` (Long, nullable = true)
- `durationMinutes` (Double, nullable = true)
- `formattedDuration` (String, e.g. "00:18:42")
- `status` (String: `"ACTIVE"`, `"COMPLETED"`, `"CANCELLED"`)
- `notes` (String, columnDefinition = "TEXT")
- `createdAt` (LocalDateTime, nullable = false)
- `updatedAt` (LocalDateTime)

