DTO for Smart Auto Assignment Engine foundation (userId, userName, activeLeads, pendingFollowups, todayActiveTasks, todayCallTimeSeconds, overdueTasks, workloadScore, preferredForAutoAssignment).

#### [NEW] [CallService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/CallService.java) & [CallServiceImpl.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/impl/CallServiceImpl.java)
Implement core call tracking business logic:
- `startCall(Long leadId, String userEmail)`: Validates ownership and single active call constraint; creates `CallHistory` record with `ACTIVE` status; broadcasts WebSocket notification (`CALL_STARTED`).
- `endCall(Long callId, String userEmail, String notes)`: Sets `endTime`, calculates `durationSeconds`, formats `"HH:mm:ss"`, updates status to `COMPLETED`; broadcasts WebSocket notification (`CALL_ENDED`).
- `getActiveCall(String userEmail)`: Fetches active call session for logged-in user.
- `getCallHistoryForLead(Long leadId)`: Fetches complete call history for a lead.
- `getUserCallAnalytics(String userEmail)`: Computes user productivity stats & charts.
- `getTeamCallAnalytics(String managerEmail)`: Computes team productivity & leaderboard.
- `getAdminCallAnalytics(String adminEmail)`: Computes org-wide call analytics.
- `getCallReports(String userEmail, String startDate, String endDate)`: Generates report dataset.

#### [NEW] [SmartAssignmentService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/SmartAssignmentService.java)
Implement workload score engine foundation:
$$\text{Workload Score} = \text{Active Leads} + \text{Pending Follow-ups} + \text{Today's Tasks} + \left(\frac{\text{Today Call Seconds}}{1800}\right) + \text{Overdue Tasks}$$
Calculates scores across workspace members to determine optimal lead assignment candidates.

